{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34818","headline":"喜王驾小仪重阳相访 · 司空图","name":"喜王驾小仪重阳相访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白菊初开卧内明，闻君相访病身轻。\n樽前且拨伤心事，谿上还随觅句行。\n幽鹤傍人疑旧识，残蝉向日噪新晴。\n拟将寂寞同留住，且劝康时立大名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}